                "type": "text",
                "text": "Time: █████"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Location: █████████"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Record Keeper: Cains, doctoral candidate, Department of Memory Zone Biological Sciences, University of Veritas Prime"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f27da16a9de56bb0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Observational Records"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-30082b93db8851b2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I no longer remember how long it's been since I arrived at Penacony... At any rate, the last few days were spent observing the many never-before-seen nor documented creatures here."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I discovered a jellyfish species that can only be seen through a special filter, presenting what seemed like a bed of flowers blooming in the ocean."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hoping to see more of these magnificent creatures, I suited up with my equipment and dived into far deeper Memory Zones."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "But it was dark, pitch-black everywhere... The darkness that loomed over my consciousness suffocated and tormented me..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A gigantic ship skidded past me. Resplendent lights illuminated its interiors, seemingly hosting a dance party attended by strange creatures. Looks like those legends are true after all."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Soon after, it... it appeared before me..."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "In the form of a thin and transparent membrane, crawling across the water's surface."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "My mind became waterlogged, as if ready to drip moisture and grow mold any time"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "My soul is gliding through the air"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The daydream before my eyes is twisting and shattering"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I dive between water and air"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Witnessing ████"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I'm glowing with light ██, ████"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(All words after are illegible.)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3964288992c072d8"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
